// height, the smallest in-block position); offset/pageSize select the same
// ascending window [offset, offset+pageSize) regardless of direction. When
// reverse is false the retained window is returned in ascending order; when
// it is true the same occurrences are returned in the opposite order —
// height descending, then position descending — with their original
// positions kept, not renumbered. The retained slice never holds more than
// pageSize records. Ordering depends only on height and in-block position;
// block timestamps (missing, equal, or decreasing) never affect it. The
// caller must hold index.mu.
